{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12969","headline":"东平蓬莱驿夜宴平卢杨判官醉後赠别姚太守置酒留宴 · 独孤及","name":"东平蓬莱驿夜宴平卢杨判官醉後赠别姚太守置酒留宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驿楼涨海壖，秋月寒城边。\n相见自不足，况逢主人贤。\n夜清酒浓人如玉，一斗何啻直十千。\n木兰爲樽金爲杯，江南急管卢女弦。\n齐童如花解郢曲，起舞激楚歌采莲。\n固知别多相逢少，乐极哀至心婵娟。\n少留莫辞醉，前路方悠然。\n明日分飞傥相忆，祗应遥望西南天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}